            "resolutionEvidence": [
              {
                "kind": "technical-record",
                "recordId": "polish-r24/independent-review.json",
                "observation": "In my 256 px downscales of ortho front, az-0 and az-315, the dark ring is legible as a distinct mount, exactly as in the human-approved r21/r22 lineage. The bolts are a close-up detail and were never needed for native-size identity. Contact-sheet framing is a presentation matter.",
